  "html": "<p>MZ+\n</p><p>6-7轮4天\n</p><p>1\t失踪\n</p><p>2\t自杀\n</p><p>3\t破局\n</p><p>4\t阴谋活动\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\".E7.89.B9.E6.AE.8A.E8.A7.84.E5.88.99\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"特殊规则\">特殊规则</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"编辑章节的源代码： 特殊规则\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://tragedyrooper.fandom.com/zh/wiki/MZ%2B01?action=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"编辑章节的源代码： 特殊规则\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>1 主人公行动阶段，队长可以翻开剧作家放置的1张行动牌(每天不限次数，每轮限X次，X=当前轮回数-1)\n</p><p>2 剧本使用了非官方角色<a href=\"/zh/wiki/%E4%BB%99%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"仙人\">仙人</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"MZ.2B-01.E9.9D.9E.E5.85.AC.E5.BC.80.E4.BF.A1.E6.81.AF.E8.A1.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"MZ+-01非公开信息表\"><a href=\"/zh/wiki/MZ%2B-01%E9%9D%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%A1%A8\" title=\"MZ+-01非公开信息表\">MZ+-01非公开信息表</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"编辑章节的源代码： MZ+-01非公开信息表\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://tragedyrooper.fandom.com/zh/wiki/MZ%2B01?action=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"编辑章节的源代码： MZ+-01非公开信息表\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260927044208\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100